1. The exact objective
Implement the supplied DESIGN(2).md colour design system throughout Cultgig while preserving the current website exactly in every non-colour respect.

This is a colour-only migration. The visual output should retain the exact existing page architecture, page composition, layout, spacing, component dimensions, typography, imagery, copy, content, routes, interactions and application behaviour. Only colour values and colour-dependent visual effects (backgrounds, text/icon colours, borders, focus colours, gradients, overlays and shadows) may change, in accordance with the design-system file.

The final site must look like the same Cultgig website with the new colour identity applied consistently—not a new theme concept, redesigned page, or rebuilt application.
